<title>BELGIUM: CBR to raise China Century Cement stake to 30 pct.</title>
<headline>CBR to raise China Century Cement stake to 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian cement-maker CBR said on Monday it had agreed to raise its stake in China Century Cement Limited (CCC) to 30 percent from the current five.</p>
</text>
